      "description": "Keep score in seconds — for card games, board games, and game nights.\n\nScore Block is a fast and reliable scorekeeper for games like Rummy, Skat, Doppelkopf, and many more. Enter points round by round, and the app automatically calculates totals so you always know who is leading.\n\nYou can review each round in detail, continue unfinished games anytime, and use old games as templates to start new matches faster.\n\nAlso included: a flexible dice tool. Roll classic 1–6 or choose any custom range from 0 to 999,999,999.\n\nFeatures:\n\n - Quick and simple score tracking\n - Automatic total calculation after every round\n - Leader and start-player indication\n - Round-by-round score overview\n - Save and continue games anytime\n - Reuse old games as templates\n - Flexible dice with custom ranges (0–999,999,999)",
